\section{Decision-maker summary}
The pipeline created a coherent, reconciled set of analytical outputs, but unresolved repeated-assessment authority and limited prediction validation constrain interpretation. The Spring forecast is a planning estimate, not an independently verified outcome or measure of intervention impact. Future analyses should maintain an audit trail of source keys, selected attempts, rejected attempts, versioned decision rules, and supporting QA reports.

